        "title": "Filter hallucinated new files in getFileVersionUpdates",
        "summary": "getFileVersionUpdates now filters newFiles to existingNewFilePaths before calling getRelevantFileInfoMessage. Checks loadedFiles[path] and content !== null. Prevents hallucinated files from triggering file info messages.",
        "significance": "minor",
        "at": "2026-09-15T17:37:28.101Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "When you ask the assistant to review files that changed in a project, it now skips over any made-up file names that don't actually exist on disk. This means you won't see confusing or irrelevant information pop up about files that were never really there. It's a small, behind-the-scenes fix to keep the answers tidy and accurate.",
