      "eli5": {
        "text": "A new version of the assistant is now available to download and use. This update bundles several recent additions together, including a new high-end reasoning model, an alternative backend for the budget-friendly mode, tab completion for file paths in the command-line tool, and a simplified home page with an autoplaying welcome video. The version-number bump itself does not change how the assistant works; it just packages all of those improvements into one ready-to-install release that you can get today.",
